---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base title="Windshield & Glass — Airborne Dent Repair" description="Windshield replacement in Gunter, Texas \— mobile at your home or workplace, or in the shop. Free estimate. Serving DFW and North Texas." nav="Services" css="retail">
<main>
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Windshield &amp; Glass</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">A Crack Only Goes<br>One Direction.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Windshield replacement in Gunter, Texas — mobile at your home or workplace, or in the shop, whichever suits you. Free estimate either way.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure slot">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Photo needed &mdash; real windshield job</span>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">In Plain Terms</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">The Glass Is Structural.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">A windshield is bonded to the body, not dropped into it. It helps the roof hold its shape in a rollover, and on most vehicles built in the last decade it is also the mounting point for the camera that runs lane keeping and automatic emergency braking.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">Which is why it is not a part to shop on price alone, and why replacing one properly takes longer than the twenty minutes people tend to expect.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">The Short Version</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Estimate</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Mobile or in-shop &mdash; your call</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hours</dt><dd>Monday&ndash;Saturday, 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Service area</dt><dd>Gunter &middot; DFW &amp; North Texas</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="border-top:1px solid var(--hair)">
  <div class="wrap sec-head">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Proof</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Damage Was Real.</h2>
    <p class="prose rv rv-d2">This slot is deliberately empty. Every photograph on this site is a job this shop actually did, and we do not have this one yet.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ba-feature ba-half rv rv-d1">
      <div class="ba slot" style="aspect-ratio:1200/769;align-items:flex-end">
        <span class="slot-tag">Photo needed &mdash; real windshield before &amp; after</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap detail">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Detail</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 0;max-width:18ch">Before You Book.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="detail-list rv rv-d1">
      <li>
        <strong>Mobile or in-shop</strong>
        <span>Both are offered. Mobile comes to your driveway or your office; in-shop gives us controlled conditions, which matters in wind, cold or rain.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: mobile service radius</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Chips and cracks</strong>
        <span>Some damage can be repaired rather than replaced, depending on size and where on the glass it sits.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: chip repair offered, or replacement only</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Driver assistance cameras</strong>
        <span>A camera mounted to the glass generally needs recalibrating after a replacement. Skipped, lane keeping and emergency braking can read the road wrong.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: ADAS recalibration &mdash; in-house, sublet, or not offered</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Which glass goes in</strong>
        <span>OEM, OE-equivalent and aftermarket glass are not the same part at the same price, and you should know which one you are getting.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: glass sourcing</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Insurance</strong>
        <span>Glass is often handled differently from a body claim.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: glass claims handled directly</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">How It Goes</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Steps.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps steps-4">
  <div class="step rv rv-d0">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Free estimate</h3>
    <p>Call with the year, make and model, and where the vehicle will be.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Mobile or in-shop</h3>
    <p>You pick. Mobile needs somewhere reasonably sheltered to work.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>The replacement</h3>
    <p>Set properly, with the adhesive given the cure time it needs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d3">
    <p class="n">04</p>
    <h3>Before you drive</h3>
    <p>We tell you how long to leave it before the car goes back to normal use.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Also In The Bay</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Other Three.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="others">
  <a class="other rv" href="/hail-damage-repair">
    <h3>Hail Damage Repair</h3>
    <p>Whole-storm damage or a single dented panel, repaired without touching the factory paint.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/paintless-dent-repair">
    <h3>Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair</h3>
    <p>Door dings, creases and transport damage — no filler, no paint, lifetime warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/window-tint">
    <h3>XPEL Window Tint</h3>
    <p>XPEL film exclusively, carrying the manufacturer's warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
</div>
<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Request an estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
